<meta charset="utf-8" />
<meta name="description" content="Welcome to the Copernicus Data Space Ecosystem, an open ecosystem that provides free instant access to a wide range of data and services from the Copernicus Sentinel missions and more on our planet’s land, oceans and atmosphere.The Copernicus Data Space Ecosystem not only ensures the continuity of the open and free access to Copernicus data but also extends the portfolio for data processing and data access possibilities. Delve into the data immediately via the Copernicus Browser or register to create an account and have an even better comprehensive exploration experience." />
